<title>INDIA: Union Bank of India cuts prime to 15.5 pct - PTI.</title>
<headline>Union Bank of India cuts prime to 15.5 pct - PTI.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Union Bank of India cut its prime lending rate to 15.5 percent from 16 percent, effective on October 1, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The news agency said the bank's other lending rates were unchanged.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
